contentText:
Tokischa has enjoyed her acting debut in House of Guerrero so much that she’s not ruling out pursuing a parallel career onscreen alongside her music journey.

The Dominican singer hinted at this last week during Billboard Latin Music Week, where she participated in the &#8220;Film and Music&#8221; panel alongside the film’s lead actor, Carlos Sanson Jr., and film and television producer Scott Budnick, CEO of 1Community.

